  "description": "Roo Pocket is a kangaroo-shaped play tower in Banana Yellow for younger children, aged 3 to 9. Children climb into the kangaroo's pouch, where a trampoline lets them hop like a joey, and then slide down the kangaroo's tail. It is compact, with a product area of 12'5\" x 5'9\" and a safe play area of 18'5\" x 9'9\", so it suits nursery schools, small society gardens and resort kids' corners. Jumping, climbing and sliding build cardiovascular fitness, balance and coordination. Its pipes, moulded body, laminates and rope are under our 3-year warranty. We can show you where Roo Pocket fits on a layout drawing of your site.",
